# wvkbd: swipe mode (SIGRTMIN+1, or WVKBD_SWIPE at start). A first finger on a letter sends
# nothing until it lifts: a tap types the letter, a stroke prints its keys between the
# bytes 0x02 and 0x03 on stdout, with a line drawn behind the finger.
